{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Turn-Based Roguelike Game]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with the wizard Isha, embark on an adventure to decipher the magic book and resolve the anomalies occurring in this land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Conquer Dungeons with Various Builds]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the roguelike element of obtaining items each time you defeat enemies, you can also customize the items you take with you when challenging dungeons to suit your preferences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress in deciphering the magic book, you'll be able to freely create spells by combining the decoded words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think up the ultimate build and conquer the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Unique and Diverse Characters]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The playable characters include the protagonist, Isha; Isha's sister, Lipka; and their childhood friend, the elf Zeeka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has different items and stats that they bring into dungeons. If you're stuck on a challenge, trying a different character might just do the trick!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523760?t=1741338092","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741338092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523760/7f3cf44f06cf081103f0ab9de9681f2f80667b9b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741338092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523760/7f3cf44f06cf081103f0ab9de9681f2f80667b9b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741338092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Turn-Based Roguelike Game]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Together with the wizard Isha, embark on an adventure to decipher the magic book and resolve the anomalies occurring in this land!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Conquer Dungeons with Various Builds]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the roguelike element of obtaining items each time you defeat enemies, you can also customize the items you take with you when challenging dungeons to suit your preferences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress in deciphering the magic book, you'll be able to freely create spells by combining the decoded words.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think up the ultimate build and conquer the dungeons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>[Unique and Diverse Characters]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The playable characters include the protagonist, Isha; Isha's sister, Lipka; and their childhood friend, the elf Zeeka.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has different items and stats that they bring into dungeons. If you're stuck on a challenge, trying a different character might just do the trick!</p>","developers":["\u653e\u8ab2\u5f8c\u306e\u751f\u5f92\u4f1a\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523760/header.jpg?t=1741338092","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098100,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098100/movie480.mp4?t=1740748570","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098100/movie_max.mp4?t=1740748570"},"name":"\u30a4\u30fc\u30b7\u30e3\u306e\u9b54\u6cd5\u66f8\u89e3\u8aad\u5ba4","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098100/c290dad88c1de33b158529543ea8